---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Case studies — Blue Unicorn"
  description="Real projects: from patent to Amazon, e-bikes with SORIE™, and products launched at trade shows. Results on the ground."
  showHeader={true}
>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden flex items-end" style="background:#0F2548;">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 md:w-2/5 opacity-[0.07]" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 40%, #0088B3 100%);"></div>
    <span class="absolute select-none pointer-events-none" style="right:-0.05em;bottom:-0.22em;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(8rem,28vw,22rem);line-height:0.8;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);letter-spacing:-0.06em;">CASES</span>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-16 pb-5 md:pt-20 md:pb-6">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3" style="color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Blue Unicorn</p>
    <h1 class="leading-[0.92] tracking-tight mb-3" style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Cases
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-[42ch] leading-relaxed mb-4" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Ideas that reached the factory, Amazon and the market.
    </p>
    <nav class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap gap-4 sm:gap-x-10 sm:gap-y-3" aria-label="Jump to a case">
      <a href="#roll-order" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">01</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Roll Order</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#e-bike" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">02</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Electric bike</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#padel-watch" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">03</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Padel smart watch</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<article id="roll-order" class="caso-block relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <span class="caso-bg-num caso-bg-num--left select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="color:rgba(22,54,103,0.03);">01</span>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:#0F2548;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Business · Product · Amazon</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;text-wrap:balance;">Roll Order</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium mb-8 max-w-[36ch] leading-snug" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">
          From a patent document to a product selling on Amazon.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-[48ch]">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Challenge</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              The client arrived with patent documentation. They had a protected idea — but not the product, the factory, or the sales channel.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              We developed the product end to end: industrialization, manufacturing, packaging, logistics and import. Then the Amazon launch and promotion.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Result</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              Product industrialized, imported and launched on Amazon. The patent stopped being a document and became a business in the market.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://roll-order.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="caso-link mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">
          roll-order.com
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="caso-visual relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <ol class="pipeline flex flex-col gap-0 w-full max-w-[420px]">
          <li class="pipeline-step" style="--c:#0F2548;"><span class="pipeline-dot"></span><span class="pipeline-label">Patent</span></li>
          <li class="pipeline-step" style="--c:#163667;"><span class="pipeline-dot"></span><span class="pipeline-label">Product</span></li>
          <li class="pipeline-step" style="--c:#0B4F7A;"><span class="pipeline-dot"></span><span class="pipeline-label">Factory</span></li>
          <li class="pipeline-step" style="--c:#00698D;"><span class="pipeline-dot"></span><span class="pipeline-label">Import</span></li>
          <li class="pipeline-step pipeline-step--last" style="--c:#0088B3;"><span class="pipeline-dot"></span><span class="pipeline-label">Amazon</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article id="e-bike" class="caso-block relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#0A1628;">
  <span class="caso-bg-num caso-bg-num--right select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">02</span>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:#A8D8EA;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Product · SORIE™ · Import</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;text-wrap:balance;">Shared-use electric bike</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium mb-8 max-w-[40ch] leading-snug" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">
          The perfect bike checklist — and tariffs that jumped from 10% to 70%.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-[48ch]">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Challenge</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              A Spanish client building charging stations and e-bike rental for municipalities. Bikes bought in Spain were failing: stolen seats and baskets, snap-off kickstands, and other design issues for heavy shared use.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              We defined the perfect bike and applied SORIE™: competition analysis, manufacturers, trade fairs, and a factory trip with the CEO. We developed the full product — including how to navigate the tariff hike from 10% to 70%.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Result</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              A product built for urban rental, suppliers validated at origin, and a cost structure adapted to the new tariff scenario.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/en/sorie-methodology" class="caso-link mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#A8D8EA;">
          See SORIE™ methodology
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="caso-visual relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[420px] flex flex-col gap-10">
          <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 px-2">
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2.5 flex-1">
              <span class="font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem);color:#A8D8EA;">10%</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Before</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-10 opacity-50" style="color:#0088B3;">
              <svg width="52" height="30" viewBox="0 0 40 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h30M24 4l12 8-12 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2.5 flex-1">
              <span class="font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem);color:#ffffff;">70%</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Tariff</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end px-1 pt-3 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);">
            <span class="font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#A8D8EA;">S</span>
            <span class="font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#7EC8E3;">O</span>
            <span class="font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#0088B3;">R</span>
            <span class="font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#40B0D0;">I</span>
            <span class="font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#ffffff;">E</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-center text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Methodology applied</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article id="padel-watch" class="caso-block relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#F2F5F8;">
  <span class="caso-bg-num caso-bg-num--left select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="color:rgba(22,54,103,0.04);">03</span>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Industrialization · Logistics · Import</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;text-wrap:balance;">Padel smart watch</h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium mb-8 max-w-[40ch] leading-snug" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">
          From prototype to Spain’s top padel fair — and toward a global launch.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-[48ch]">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Challenge</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              Invention studios often stop at the prototype. The hard jump is industrializing, importing and getting the product to market.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              Support for industrialization, logistics and import. Padelgest Hit X was presented at Spain’s most important padel fair, in Barcelona.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Result</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              Product shown at the fair and moving toward a global launch. From prototype to an import and go-to-market operation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://comunicae.es/notas-de-prensa/padelgest-revoluciona-el-padel-con-hit-x-el" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="caso-link mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">
          Press release — Padelgest / Hit X
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="caso-visual relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <ol class="stair w-full max-w-[440px] flex flex-col gap-3">
          <li class="stair-step" style="--c:#0F2548; --w:58%;">
            <span class="stair-num">01</span>
            <span class="stair-label">Prototype</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stair-step" style="--c:#163667; --w:72%;">
            <span class="stair-num">02</span>
            <span class="stair-label">Industrialization</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stair-step" style="--c:#00698D; --w:86%;">
            <span class="stair-num">03</span>
            <span class="stair-label">Barcelona fair</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stair-step stair-step--last" style="--c:#0088B3; --w:100%;">
            <span class="stair-num">04</span>
            <span class="stair-label">Global launch</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<section style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-24 flex flex-col items-center" style="text-align:center;">
    <p class="font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.2]" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Behind these projects is a team that works from the ground — product, manufacturing and digital channels.
      <a href="/en/about-us" class="caso-link whitespace-nowrap" style="color:#163667;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;">Learn more on About us</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 md:px-12 py-20 md:py-28" style="background:#0A1628;">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 w-2/3 h-2/3 opacity-[0.06]" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 80%, #0088B3 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6" style="color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">And also</p>
    <h2 class="font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-6" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,4.5vw,3rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Among other stories, we’ve taken sound, campaigns and digital presence where the brand needed to go.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[46ch]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Artists positioned. Campaign spotlights. Marketing layers you don’t see in the factory — and you do feel in the market.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:#F2F5F8;">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-20 flex flex-col items-center" style="text-align:center;">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Press</p>
    <h2 class="font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-5" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,4.5vw,3rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Featured in Cinco Días
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[48ch]" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;text-align:center;">
      The firm is led by Luis Chicharro, with a track record in business development, internationalization, proprietary brand creation, and scaling through digital channels. His approach was featured in <a href="https://cincodias.elpais.com/companias/2023-04-11/los-secretos-para-vender-en-plataformas-como-amazon.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#163667;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Cinco Días (Grupo El País)</a>, where he explained how to build real businesses on digital platforms — from product and manufacturing to sales.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12 md:gap-20 px-6 md:px-12 py-12 md:py-32" style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <div class="text-center md:text-left max-w-lg">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">Every case starts<br>with a<br>conversation</h2>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">If you have a project, an idea or a business you want to take further, let’s talk. No commitment.</p>
    <div class="mt-8">
      <a href="/en/get-started" class="animated-btn" style="position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:56px;padding:0 52px 0 36px;font-size:16px;background-color:#0F2548;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 0.625em 1.2em 0 rgba(15,37,72,0.2);">
        <span class="text" style="position:relative;z-index:2;transition:transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);">Tell us about your project</span>
        <svg class="arr-1" style="position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-10px;width:20px;height:20px;z-index:2;right:22px;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <svg class="arr-2" style="position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-10px;width:20px;height:20px;z-index:2;left:-25%;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span class="circle" style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:20px;height:20px;background-color:#00698D;border-radius:50%;opacity:0;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);"></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24"><path d="M50 8 Q50 50 92 50 Q50 50 50 92 Q50 50 8 50 Q50 50 50 8Z" fill="#0F2548" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24"><rect x="8" y="8" width="84" height="84" rx="3" fill="#163667" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="#0B4F7A" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24"><polygon points="50,4 96,96 4,96" fill="#00698D" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<footer style="background:#0F2548;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 md:gap-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <a href="/en" style="text-decoration:none;">
          <div class="inline-block rounded p-3" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);">
            <img src="/images/logo-marino.png" alt="Blue Unicorn" class="h-10 md:h-11 w-auto" />
          </div>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-[28ch]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);">Real Solutions for Extraordinary Ideas.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 mt-1">
